I'm going to be running in and out of the hospital for the rest of the day so I won't be able to check email frequently.

If at least 5 people don't express an interest in meeting tomorrow, let's scrap it until early November. In the meantime, I'll plan on setting up a meetup.com <http://meetup.com> account so that we can coordinate this a little better in the future.

